  note      = {Verified via CEUR-WS volume 304 and the official proceedings contents. Gives a theoretical framework for the step that turns a matrix of similarity values into a final alignment, and shows on OAEI 2006 submissions that the choice of extraction method materially changes precision and recall, with extractors that use information encoded in the ontologies outperforming the state of the art.}
