  year      = {1995},
  url       = {https://www.ijcai.org/Proceedings/95-1/Papers/083.pdf},
  note      = {Verified via the IJCAI 1995 proceedings PDF, whose printed folios run 631--637. Replaces the ad hoc aggregation operators of earlier soft-constraint proposals with a single ordered commutative monoid of valuations, which subsumes classical, possibilistic, weighted and probabilistic CSP, and uses the common setting to compare those proposals on rationality and computational complexity and to say which classical CSP algorithms extend to each.}
